Eliminate Test2::Harness2::Util::CwdIndex

When looking for the most recent yath archive look based on the default archive name in temp.

Default name for yath archives:

    $TMPDIR/<PROJECT>-$USER-<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.yath

See App::Yath2::Options::Yath, 'project' option, which can be command line or
in the .yath.rc. I have added comments to that file as well.

With that default You can always grab the latest based on timestamp.


ipc file should be:

    $TMPDIR/<PROJECT>-$USER-<command>-<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>-yath-ipc.json

